msgstr "Put back in order"

msgid "passe devant"
msgstr "moved to the front"

msgid "La narration minute par minute. La table qui grossit le plus vite, et celle que personne ne relit."
msgstr "The minute-by-minute narration. The fastest-growing table there is, and the one nobody rereads."

msgid "Le dossier de recherche, l’article tel que la machine l’a écrit, les prompts d’image. Le verdict, la revue et la recette restent quoi qu’il arrive."
msgstr "The research package, the article as the machine wrote it, the image prompts. The verdict, the review and the recipe stay whatever happens."

msgid "Le nettoyage n’a encore jamais tourné."
msgstr "The cleanup has never run yet."

msgid "Nettoyage…"
msgstr "Cleaning…"

msgid "Nettoyer maintenant"
msgstr "Clean now"

msgid "Productions lourdes"
msgstr "Heavy output"

msgid "Trois durées, parce que trois choses vieillissent différemment. À zéro, rien de cette sorte n’est jamais supprimé."
msgstr "Three ages, because three things decay at different rates. At zero, nothing of that kind is ever removed."

msgid "Un filtre impose une autre durée pour : %s. C’est le filtre qui s’applique, pas ce qui est saisi ici."
msgstr "A filter imposes a different age for: %s. The filter is what applies, not what is typed here."

msgid "Un passage est borné : il retire ce qu’il peut sans faire tomber la requête, et reprend au suivant. Chaque durée est aussi un filtre — msrwa_retention_events_days, msrwa_retention_artifacts_days, msrwa_retention_runs_days."
msgstr "A pass is bounded: it removes what it can without bringing the request down, and picks up where it left off on the next one. Each age is also a filter — msrwa_retention_events_days, msrwa_retention_artifacts_days, msrwa_retention_runs_days."

msgid "Enregistrer les durées"
msgstr "Save these ages"

msgid "Départ"
msgstr "Leaves"

msgid "Ouvrir"
msgstr "Open"

msgid "Pas encore parti"
msgstr "Not gone yet"

msgid "attend votre confirmation"
msgstr "waiting for you"

